-    *   **+Y:** Neighbor at `coord + ivec3(0, 1, 0)` is empty [S1, unofficial].
-    *   **-Y:** Neighbor at `coord + ivec3(0, -1, 0)` is empty [S1, unofficial].
-    *   **+Z:** Neighbor at `coord + ivec3(0, 0, 1)` is empty [S1, unofficial].
-    *   **-Z:** Neighbor at `coord + ivec3(0, 0, -1)` is empty [S1, unofficial].
